1 NAME Yasmeen Lari, /Lahore/
1 SEX F
1 NOTE Root place: Lar
1 NOTE Current place: Lahore, Pakistan
1 NOTE https://www.suhaillaripakistan.com/chapters/Yasmeen-Lari/ 1963 First Woman Architect of Pakistan 2013 Ms. Lari was declared Islamic Development Bank (Jeddah) Laureate, Ms. Lari’s work was exhibited in the First Chicago
2 CONC Architectural Biennale. When one of the important heritage sites in Pakistan, that is the Shish Mahal of Lahore Fort, was endangered, UNESCO appointed Yasmeen Lari National Advisor for conservation and preservation of
2 CONC Lahore Fort. She devised the Karavan MeraPakistan programme, to safeguard historic buildings, to foster a duty of care for heritage assets, to develop pride and a stake in the city by initiating a sustained process of
2 CONC cleaning and washing Karachi's heritage. This was done by involving school children and by white washing posters from walls and replacing them with paintings by students. These functions were held in Karachi from
2 CONC 2001-2004, followed by several cities ranging from Bahawalpur Palaces, Darawar Fort and the World Heritage Sites of Lahore's Shahi Qila and Buddhist monuments of Taxila. UNESCO devoted a chapter to Yasmeen Lari as one of
2 CONC sixty women from all over the world who had made a significant contribution to UNESCO since its inception.
